  description:
  - It is recommended for your first few nights to plant only a handful of crops.
    The local fauna are keen on the presence of crops, and will appear more frequently
    depending on the number of actively growing crops.
  leftText: 
  rightText: The amount and type of creatures that appear at night is heavily influenced
    by what is currently growing on your farm. Each crop has an "Allure" value that
    displays how much it influences the difficulty of the night. The higher the value,
    the harder the difficulty.
